<title>GERMANY: Dynamit Nobel 95/96 sales up five pct.</title>
<headline>Dynamit Nobel 95/96 sales up five pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOGNE 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to September 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group sales				  3,707   vs 3,529</p>
<p>    Group income from ord. activities    191     vs 141</p>
<p>    Group return on sales		    5.2 pct vs 4.0 pct</p>
<p>    Group gross cash flow		    421     vs 370</p>
<p>    Group investments			  202     vs 147</p>
<p>    Group workforce			    14,541  vs 13,125</p>
<p>NOTE - Dynamit Nobel is a unit of German metals group Metallgesellschaft AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
